{"op": "replace", "segment": 17, "text": "Nothing in this Agreement prevents the Disclosee from acquiring information similar to the Confidential Information lawfully from a third party without breaching this Agreement, but the acquisition of such information does not release the Disclosee from its obligations in respect of any Confidential Information disclosed by the Sellers, which remains protected even where similar information is also obtained from a third party.", "fixes": "S-010"},
